commit e61f76263055b4568bc4fe06a4df258c01ac33df

C03: clitic cancellation heads pass the direct-request gate (AGENDA1341)

AGENDA1339 measured: «cancelame la alarma» never reached the explicit which-alarm clarification because _is_direct_request did not admit the clitic head «cancelame» (it admits «cancelá» and «cancel»); the model path then proposed «la alarma más reciente». The clitic cancellation heads (cancelame, cancelamela, borrame, quitame, eliminame and their -la forms) are now the same speech act in the gate.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


